      "extract": "arXiv:math/9201302v1 [math.QA] 7 Oct 1991 The Quantum G2 Link Invariant Greg Kuperberg ∗ University of Chicago October 7, 1991 Abstract We derive an inductive, combinatorial deﬁnition of a polynomial-valued regular isotopy invariant of links and tangled graphs. We show that the invariant equals the Reshetikhin-Turaev invariant corre- sponding to the exceptional simple Lie algebra G2. It is therefore related to G2 in",
