      "extract": "Constructing a freeway invariant We assume that there is a scalar freeway invariant ⟨·⟩G2 whose corresponding vector invariant is | ·⟩G2 and which satisﬁes the following condition: For n < 6, the bracket of the acyclic, crossingless freeways with n endpoints are linearly independent vectors, and that the bracket of a freeway which consists of a face with n sides is a linear combination of these acyclic freeways.",
